endered field is the Swift-Hohenberg amplitude equation. | Machine execution of the Lean file: this image has no lean binary.]; phenomenon_size: 188 µm (0.0001883 m, log10=-3.725 m, tier=5_primordium_100um); species_scale_ladder (10 runs from 188 µm to 28.5 cm): 188 µm:cavia-porcellus-bioelectric-polarity, 666 µm:cavia-porcellus-vertex-packing, 6.3 mm:cavia-porcellus-turing-wavelength, 2.3 cm:cavia-porcellus-clock-wavefront, 4.0 cm:cavia-porcellus-morphogen-condensation, 5.1 cm:cavia-porcellus-flux-canalization, 5.5 cm:cavia-porcellus-elastic-buckling, 6.6 cm:cavia-porcellus-branching-tree" ;
